# A fast tour for the landing page across a busy list: send a marked agent a follow-up so it is
# working on camera, jump to another by its mark and open its details, archive an agent, then
# search every transcript and jump to what the search found.
key Escape
key Escape
key Escape
key C-g
sleep 300ms
key Escape
sleep 700ms
key '
key p
key Enter
sleep 300ms
type Now add a rollback step for payouts that fail halfway, and list what it must undo.
key Enter
sleep 1500ms
key C-a
key '
key c
sleep 700ms
key C-t
sleep 900ms
key C-t
key g
key j
sleep 300ms
key z
sleep 400ms
key C-s
sleep 900ms
key s
type refund
sleep 1000ms
key Enter
sleep 1500ms
